WEBVTT

00:00:01.725 --> 00:00:05.629
Job Agent: the daily search and the settings
What to switch on, and what your computer needs

00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:09.383
Tick "every morning by itself"
Right under the search box

00:00:09.383 --> 00:00:15.970
It searches at 08:02 every day
Even when the app is closed. Full search on your search day, a quick refresh on the others.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:20.706
What your computer needs
Only to be on at 08:02. Nothing to install: the app adds one entry to the system scheduler.

00:00:20.706 --> 00:00:25.684
On a Mac
A Mac that was asleep runs it when it wakes. If "Background Items Added" appears, leave it allowed.

00:00:25.684 --> 00:00:31.365
On Windows and Linux
If the computer is off at 08:02, that morning is skipped: press Search when you are back.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:34.849
Switch it off here, or uninstall
Either one removes the daily search from the system

00:00:34.849 --> 00:00:41.197
Where to look
Countries, and the job sites for each. The common ones are on already.

00:00:41.197 --> 00:00:44.889
Employers to watch
Their own careers pages are checked on every search

00:00:44.889 --> 00:00:50.252
How the documents are written
Ten kinds of position. Each starts with a suggestion you can tune.

00:00:50.252 --> 00:00:54.115
Optional: your own API keys
For AI drafts and extra job sources. Everything works without them.

00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:58.374
Want it to search with your computer off?
Put the search on your own Cloudflare account (the free plan is enough)

00:00:58.374 --> 00:01:02.857
See what it did
Every request it made, also the morning runs, and what each one carried

00:01:02.857 --> 00:01:08.008
Update or remove it here
Uninstall also removes the daily search

00:01:08.008 --> 00:01:14.955
Each morning: open the app
The new jobs wait under To decide
